# School ERP — Communication Module

## Layout

```
modules/communication/
├── controller/ service/ provider/ template/
├── dto/ entity/ scheduler/
└── (standard: dto/request, dto/response, mapper, validator, enums as needed)
```

## Channels

SMS, WhatsApp, Email — implement via `provider/` abstractions; templates in `template/`.

## Processing

- Use `scheduler/` for batched/async notification delivery
- Reuse constants for template keys and provider config
- Do not log credentials or message secrets

Only add controllers/services when explicitly requested.
